01:06:01.410 --> 01:06:04.920
I do believe I saw him fishing when I was searching for my handkins.

01:06:04.920 --> 01:06:05.740
Oh!

01:06:05.740 --> 01:06:08.770
Dear me, do take care Mrs. Diggywinkle.

01:06:08.770 --> 01:06:11.560
I'm not as young as I used to be.

01:06:11.560 --> 01:06:14.670
Mind how you go Miss Lucy with your clean boots.

01:06:14.670 --> 01:06:16.670
Water and mud everywhere.

01:06:16.670 --> 01:06:18.670
Don't know how it can be.

01:06:18.670 --> 01:06:19.500
So, there.

01:06:19.500 --> 01:06:22.450
A gentleman has a right to live how he will.

01:06:22.450 --> 01:06:26.240
Good, Jeremy!

01:06:26.240 --> 01:06:28.200
Ladies! Ahoy!

01:06:28.200 --> 01:06:30.000
I was just about to leave your place.

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:34.240
clean washing and collect from the porch as usual, Mr. Jeremy, sir.

01:06:34.240 --> 01:06:40.140
Ah, yes. I mean, no, dear lady. Afternoon, ma'am.

01:06:40.140 --> 01:06:41.140
How do you do?

01:06:41.140 --> 01:06:47.320
Afraid I have some rather dirty linen here in this basket, so as not to muddy your gown.

01:06:47.320 --> 01:06:55.270
In the basket? Bless my soul. Oh, dear mercy me, Mr. Jeremy.

01:06:55.270 --> 01:07:00.000
Oh, little Miss Hepp, that is to say, well,

01:07:00.090 --> 01:07:02.150
Not so little, really. More of an accident.

01:07:03.930 --> 01:07:05.310
Very, nearly fatal.

01:07:05.830 --> 01:07:07.390
Skill of my teeth and all that, don't you know?

01:07:08.020 --> 01:07:09.860
Mercy me, Mr. Jeremy.

01:07:10.200 --> 01:07:12.440
What have you done to your poor fingers?

01:07:13.190 --> 01:07:15.130
Oh, there, the very least of it.

01:07:15.440 --> 01:07:17.620
Oh, Mr. Jeremy.

01:07:18.200 --> 01:07:21.520
Much worse happened than a few scratched fingers, I assure you.

01:07:21.980 --> 01:07:25.600
A really frightful thing it would have been had I not been wearing my Mackintosh.

01:07:26.280 --> 01:07:28.740
It's a tale that hardly bears telling.

01:07:29.490 --> 01:07:30.000
In fact,

01:07:30.280 --> 01:07:35.220
I still feel a little faint of the recollection and yet the day had started so well

01:07:36.180 --> 01:07:55.160
but let me start from the beginning rain good fishing today I should wonder

01:07:56.710 --> 01:08:00.000
I'll get some worms and catch a dish of minnows for my dinner

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:20.080
I'm fine fish. I'll invite my friends Mr. Alderman Ptolemy and Sir Isaac Newton.

01:08:20.080 --> 01:08:26.850
The Alderman, however, eats salad.

01:08:31.600 --> 01:08:32.900
Macintosh?

01:08:33.790 --> 01:08:34.810
Ah!

01:08:34.810 --> 01:08:36.130
Galoshes?

01:08:36.130 --> 01:08:38.410
Mmm!

01:08:38.410 --> 01:08:39.330
No!

01:08:39.330 --> 01:08:40.630
Where did I leave...

01:08:40.630 --> 01:08:43.240
Mmm...

01:08:43.240 --> 01:08:47.160
Thought about sandwiches!

01:09:01.500 --> 01:09:03.060
I know just the place for minnows.

01:09:21.460 --> 01:09:27.290
Mr. Jeremy settled himself cross-legged and arranged his fishing tackle.

01:09:28.170 --> 01:09:29.920
He had the dearest little red float.

01:09:30.860 --> 01:09:36.340
His rod was a tough stalk of grass, his line was a fine long white horse hair,

01:09:36.340 --> 01:09:39.120
and he tied a little wriggling worm at the end.

01:09:39.120 --> 01:09:56.120
The rain trickled down his back, and for nearly an hour he stared at the float.

01:10:01.660 --> 01:10:06.610
Mmm. This is getting tiresome.

01:10:06.610 --> 01:10:12.900
I foresee, I fear, an adjustment to the dinner menu.

01:10:12.900 --> 01:10:19.910
I'll eat a butterfly sandwich and wait till the shower is over.

01:10:30.280 --> 01:10:34.400
If I could recall exactly what provisions I have in my larder...

01:10:34.400 --> 01:10:53.350
Teacher, what a nasty, underhanded thing to do.

01:10:56.110 --> 01:11:00.000
Dear me, I trust that is...

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:22.350
not a rat oh is there no peace to be had anywhere better get away from here someone excuse me sir

01:11:22.350 --> 01:11:30.000
oh that's my soul have you seen my pocket handkins or even a pinafore yeah afraid not young lady

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:30.640
Oh, well.

01:11:31.380 --> 01:11:32.940
Sorry, I can't be of more help.

01:11:34.070 --> 01:11:34.650
Eh, what?

01:11:35.020 --> 01:11:36.920
