01:12:01.120 --> 01:12:04.640
I mean, no. No! I have him by the nose!

01:12:04.990 --> 01:12:05.990
Hooray!

01:12:06.690 --> 01:12:08.130
Ow!

01:12:09.080 --> 01:12:09.580
Oh!

01:12:10.000 --> 01:12:11.700
Oh, no! Oh!

01:12:12.460 --> 01:12:15.200
Oh, no! Ouch!

01:12:15.700 --> 01:12:18.100
What are you doing on the end of my line, Jack Sharp?

01:12:18.580 --> 01:12:21.240
Ouch! Get off my boat this instant!

01:12:21.440 --> 01:12:22.310
Ow!

01:12:25.060 --> 01:12:26.720
You little rascals!

01:12:31.120 --> 01:12:38.790
What's to do?

01:12:40.340 --> 01:12:41.900
Two such good friends.

01:12:42.240 --> 01:12:45.160
One cannot sit them down to butterfly sandwiches.

01:12:46.150 --> 01:12:48.030
You expect rather a good table.

01:12:49.610 --> 01:12:51.810
If only I could remember what I have in the pantry.

01:12:54.090 --> 01:12:54.650
Grasshoppers.

01:12:55.070 --> 01:12:56.020
Just the thing.

01:12:56.950 --> 01:12:59.740
I dare say I can find a bit of lettuce for Alderman Ptolemy.

01:13:00.760 --> 01:13:01.800
But...

01:13:38.090 --> 01:14:00.000
I've been so glad to see the light of day, never has the air smelled so sweet, mercy that was not a pike, oh, my favourite rod, my basket

01:14:00.410 --> 01:14:19.740
my only pair of galoshes gone all gone oh oh no it doesn't much matter but i'm sure i should never

01:14:19.740 --> 01:14:30.000
have dared go fishing again just look at my best mackintosh all in tatters oh mercy me it was

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:37.020
