01:21:52.790 --> 01:21:56.250
How very kind of you, Julian.

01:21:56.250 --> 01:21:57.290
But I...

01:21:57.290 --> 01:21:58.290
I meant...

01:21:58.290 --> 01:21:58.990
Meow!

01:21:58.990 --> 01:22:00.000
Meow!

01:22:00.990 --> 01:22:10.920
you Julian but perhaps you'd better go along with Sarah Julian yes that's a good

01:22:10.920 --> 01:22:18.230
idea wait for me come on Julian we've got

01:22:18.230 --> 01:22:30.000
lots to do it's strange not having me Jess here with us Julian

