02:51:04.030 --> 02:51:08.410
Henry's cat had just been for a very long walk, and was feeling very hungry.

02:51:09.170 --> 02:51:12.410
Unfortunately, there were no shops around where he could buy some food.

02:51:13.300 --> 02:51:17.820
Glancing around the magnificent sweep of the landscape, he did see a large exhibition

02:51:17.820 --> 02:51:20.000
