02:53:34.200 --> 02:53:41.110
strange computers. Henry's cat saw his opportunity and said, "Oh, excuse me, sir

02:53:41.110 --> 02:53:47.610
or madam, how much does a computer cost?" The computer was silent for a moment, and

02:53:47.610 --> 02:53:52.240
Henry's cat was just about to ask the question again, when the computer said, "You

02:53:52.240 --> 02:54:00.000
don't have to repeat the question. I am not stupid, you know. How much have you

02:54:00.000 --> 02:54:03.170
