02:54:11.780 --> 02:54:13.920
The computer blinked and said rather haughtily,

02:54:14.870 --> 02:54:16.190
I'm afraid that's

02:54:16.190 --> 02:54:18.330
not enough by the long way,

02:54:18.700 --> 02:54:20.140
but I do

02:54:20.140 --> 02:54:21.980
