02:54:30.250 --> 02:54:32.260
"Oh, glad for Buddy!"

02:54:32.260 --> 02:54:37.590
"Oh, thank you," said Henry's cat, and he took the computer's hand.

02:54:37.590 --> 02:54:43.880
It seemed a very friendly computer. It buzzed and clicked merrily as Henry's cat led it away.

02:54:43.880 --> 02:54:48.690
It stopped at the curb and looked both ways before leading Henry's cat across the road.

02:54:48.690 --> 02:54:53.950
It could remember every car number it saw, and could even tell the time backwards, which was

02:54:53.950 --> 02:55:00.000
extremely useful. Henry's cat was very impressed. He hoped he could raise enough money to buy the nice

02:55:00.000 --> 02:55:05.870
computer. But how to raise the money? That was the problem. When Henry's cat got

02:55:05.870 --> 02:55:11.420
home, he thought very hard about it and decided to ask his friends for advice. So

02:55:11.420 --> 02:55:18.690
he immediately invited them all round to tea. When his friends arrived, he said, "You

02:55:18.690 --> 02:55:24.210
know, for a long time I have been considering getting a computer for my

02:55:24.210 --> 02:55:30.000
business purposes and etc." His friends were all

02:55:30.000 --> 02:55:34.990
