03:07:48.890 --> 03:07:51.590
I could bark and growl at him, suggested Macduff.

03:07:51.590 --> 03:07:55.180
But you might make Whizzer fall off his tricycle, said Bump.

03:07:55.690 --> 03:07:58.270
We don't want to hurt him, agreed Little Bun.

03:07:58.700 --> 03:08:00.000
