03:09:35.380 --> 03:09:38.920
"If I climb up there, I'm sure to see someone," he thought.

03:09:38.920 --> 03:09:42.770
So he hopped from his tricycle and scrambled to the top.

03:09:42.770 --> 03:09:47.960
"Not even bump," he sighed after looking all round.

03:09:47.960 --> 03:09:52.040
But no sooner had Whizzer spoken than something strange happened.

03:09:52.040 --> 03:09:55.370
The hill began to tremble.

03:09:55.370 --> 03:10:00.000
"Eek! What's going on?" he squealed, which made the hill tremble more than ever.

03:10:00.570 --> 03:10:04.550
Then, giggled, and actually spoke.

03:10:05.280 --> 03:10:06.620
Oh, stop it, you're tickling.

03:10:07.800 --> 03:10:12.470
It's you, Bump, gasped, did give me a fright.

03:10:13.880 --> 03:10:16.840
Serves you right for playing tricks on other people, whistled Birdie.

03:10:18.080 --> 03:10:22.730
I'll try not to be naughty, said Whizzer, but it will be very hard.

03:10:46.920 --> 03:10:47.600
We'll be right back.

